; traps.xon -- the delve set: what lies hidden in the floor.
;
; (trap NAME MESSAGE . PROPS): the message is said when one is stepped
; on; the effect is (effect hurt LO HI), (effect hold N), (effect
; aggravate) or (effect teleport).  A level has the set's (traps LO HI)
; of these, drawn at random.

(trap "pit" "You fall into a pit." (effect hurt 2 6))
(trap "snare" "A snare closes on your leg." (effect hold 3))
(trap "alarm" "A bell rings through the dark." (effect aggravate))
(trap "drop shaft" "The floor gives way, and you land somewhere else." (effect teleport))
